g it from the center\n- Connects my rooks, activating the h1 rook\n- Prepares for central pawn breaks like d2-d4\n- Follows fundamental chess principles: castle early before launching attacks\n\nKeeping my king in the center while developing other pieces would be strategically unsound and could lead to tactical vulnerabilities.\n\nAnswer: K: e1-g1"}
