is is a significant material advantage\n\nReason: N: e5-f7 is a royal fork that checks the king while attacking the h8 rook. After Black moves the king to safety, I can capture the rook on h8, winning the exchange (approximately 2 points of material advantage). This tactical blow should give me a winning advantage.\n\nAnswer: N: e5-f7"}
