 deep in my position. Capturing it with d2-c3 accomplishes several goals: (1) removes a dangerous piece, (2) improves my material situation slightly, (3) the d-pawn capturing toward the center maintains better pawn structure than b2-c3, and (4) opens the d-file potentially for my rook. This is the most concrete improvement to my position.\n\n**Answer: P: d2-c3**"}
